reviewed; <sup>b</sup>number of MSC populations (isolated from various tissues from human or mouse) reported in these studies to be mostly positive (+), somewhat positive (+/-), or negative (-); <sup>c</sup>MSCs isolated primarily from bone marrow but also from fat, skin, thymus, kidney, muscle, liver, lung, and placenta.</p></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></sec></back></article>